      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, have you heard about Renton? \r\nActually—I have something I'd like to discuss. \r\nWould you hear me out?",
        "Jp" : "ああ、レンテンの話を聞いてきてくれたのか\r\n実は――折り入って相談があるんだが\r\n話を聞く気はないか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 680638,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It happened on my way back to \r\nThe White Dragon Temple—\r\nwhile passing near the Small Cave Tombs, \r\nI saw someone carrying a weapon\r\nI've never seen before.",
        "Jp" : "あれは白竜神殿に戻ってくる道中でのことだ――\r\n《死者の小窟》の近くを通りかかった時に\r\n\"見たこともない武器\"を持った人物を見かけた"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 680639,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And it wasn't just the weapon. \r\nI couldn't even tell if it was \"human\"... \r\nIt was a mysterious figure, almost like a shadow.",
        "Jp" : "武器だけじゃない\r\n\"人間\"と言っていいのかどうか\r\nそれすらも判断できないような不思議な人影だった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 680640,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But if I say something like this,\r\npeople will probably think I'm weird.\r\nThat's why I'm only telling you right now.",
        "Jp" : "ただ、こんなことを言ったら\r\nおかしなやつだと思われるだろうから\r\n今この時、お前にしか話していない"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 745011,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Yet that mysterious figure,\r\nand that unknown weapon -\r\nthey won't leave my mind.\r\nWill you investigate in my stead?",
        "Jp" : "だがな、あの時の人影と\r\n\"見たこともない武器\"が\r\nどうしても頭から離れないんだ\r\n俺に代わって調べてきてはくれないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 745012,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1047,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Craig",
      "Jp" : "クレイグ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 27145,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I saw that figure with the unknown weapon \r\nat the Small Cave Tombs. \r\nMaybe if you go there, you'll find a clue.",
        "Jp" : "俺が\"見たことも無い武器\"を\r\n携えた人影を見たのは《死者の小窟》だ\r\nそこに行けば、何か手がかりがあると思うんだが"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 680657,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Being put in charge of part\r\nof the workshop means I must\r\nstay at the temple. But I\r\ncan't stop thinking about that\r\nweapon - so I'm relying on you.",
        "Jp" : "工房の一角を任された以上\r\n俺は神殿から離れるわけにはいかない\r\nかといって、あの武器を忘れることもできない――\r\nつまりだ、頼んだぞ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 680658,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1047,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Craig",
      "Jp" : "クレイグ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
