      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What's this?\r\nA spirit bearing both a foreign combat style, \r\nand that weapon?!\r\n-Though hard to swallow, that eerie\r\nair makes it undeniable.",
        "Jp" : "なに？\r\n異国のジョブと、その武器を携えた霊だと？！\r\n――にわかには信じられんが\r\nあの雰囲気ではそれも納得せざるを得ないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 745035,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hmm...well...alright then.\r\nWhen you master that so-called job,\r\ncome to me for weapon upgrades.\r\nI'll research new knowledge about arms until then.",
        "Jp" : "ふむ――ううむ――まぁ、いい\r\nそのジョブとやらを使いこなす時がきたら\r\n武具の進化は俺に依頼するんだぞ\r\nそれまでに、新しい武器の知識を蓄えておこう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 745036,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I never imagined it truly was a spirit... \r\nBut thanks.\r\nNow I can sleep soundly tonight without worry.",
        "Jp" : "まさか霊だったとは思わなかったが\r\nとりあえずは礼を言う\r\nこれで今晩から何にも悩まされず\r\n快適に眠れそうだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 745037,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
